 chapter and compare the two time states.","Read the creation record and art provenance.","Inspect puzzle rules separately from presentation code.","Modify one clue and verify uniqueness, hints and saved progress.","AI 工作流与开发背景","stackloomdev 指导 Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮参与故事、谜题、中英文文案、界面、代码、存档、程序化 WebGL 效果和测试。背景插画另外生成，3D 层为场景调查界面增加景深。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Custom JavaScript · DOM/CSS · WebGL · Web Audio","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[140,141,142,143],{"_63":173,"_25":107,"_17":174},{"_63":124,"_25":125,"_17":119,"_108":126},{"_63":170,"_25":116,"_171":172,"_108":117},{"_63":169,"_25":107,"_108":109},[168],"codex","Read the human and AI contribution record","Open the complete puzzle-game project","scope","complete-project","Read the creation record","build-log",{"_176":177},"documents",{"_75":178,"_35":179},[181,185,186,187,184,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,183,220,182,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238],[180,181,182,183,184],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-cas